{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:8ccd0f7add02ded1","name":"Energy-Binding Prosthesis","source":{"id":"source:reference-8ccd0f7add02ded1","title":"Energy-Binding Prosthesis","revision":26011,"timestamp":"2025-01-15T18:24:38Z","sha256":"4c477c47cf8ef54e93f38da15536f894e7d93c0ed3a63acd6b25116f74ac7e3b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=26011","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Energy-Binding%20Prosthesis&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-8ccd0f7add02ded1","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["After the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Malachor V"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Malachor_V","referenceId":"reference:c62c91d1302bb9b2"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bao-Dur"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bao-Dur","referenceId":"reference:2c0e31369cc73445"}," designs and builds himself a unique cybernetic arm that uses an energy binding in place of a mechanical elbow. The arm has normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," strength. By manipulating the energy binding in combat, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bao-Dur"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bao-Dur","referenceId":"reference:2c0e31369cc73445"}," can disrupt an opponent's personal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Shield"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Shield"}," as well as some other force fields. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Cell"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Cell","referenceId":"reference:a3dedb9c17e4ee9d"}," must be replaced every 48 hours, though ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bao-Dur"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bao-Dur","referenceId":"reference:2c0e31369cc73445"}," has included a variety of attachments to ensure he can recharge it from a variety of sources in an emergency.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Shield Breaker"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["To disrupt a field, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bao-Dur"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bao-Dur","referenceId":"reference:2c0e31369cc73445"}," must be adjacent to the target and make a successful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed"}," strike. If the attack hits, shields with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"}," of 15 or lower are disabled and provide no protection for the rest of the encounter. If the shield has a rating greater than SR 15, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"}," drops by -5, failing once it falls to SR 15 or lower. An Energy-Binding Prosthesis is ineffective against shields protecting Gargantuan or larger ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
